      "content": "but there is no \"new\" person. there's just this hollow ache. it feels so wrong to be here, living this life, when the only version of me that mattered is gone. it feels less like a \"process\" and more like i'm just a shadow haunting a life that ended when he did. does it ever feel like you're just... out of place in this world? like you're just supposed to be somewhere else?",
